Production templates (@farming-production: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @farming, #farming-practice @production-bean-dry, #farming-practice @production-cassava-root, #farming-practice @production-layer-eggs, #farming-practice @production-lettuce-head, #farming-practice @production-mango-tree, #farming-practice @production-tomato-transplant) { r_65PXZHNA5DW8ZZRCQKG3ZX8ME1
Examples demonstrate scheduling. Yields, dates, unrestricted seasons, costs, and inputs are explicit assumptions, not agronomic guarantees. Read the species lifecycle and confirm or replace every parameter at your site. Outputs are usable grams in the selected preparation after your declared conversion. Days start at establishment. Care templates require observation and suitable local husbandry.
} r_65PXZHNA5DW8ZZRCQKG3ZX8ME1

