Laying-hen eggs (@production-layer-eggs: 0, #part-of @farming-production, #species @gallus-gallus-domesticus, #produces @nutrition-br-taco-488, #produces @nutrition-br-taco-489) { r_09HHM3V8RYZYWD49QE0XBGGWS7
Use @gallus-gallus-domesticus. This example starts with healthy point-of-lay pullets, not newly hatched chicks. Confirm age, strain, supplier feeding and lighting history, expected first lay, usable yield, and care capacity. Replace all assumptions with local observations. Care and feed continue while birds remain, including after the modeled laying window or a supermarket override. [Started pullets and laying-flock management](https://extension.psu.edu/management-requirements-for-laying-flocks).
} r_09HHM3V8RYZYWD49QE0XBGGWS7

